"entity": {
"name": "Waystar Holding Corp.",
"description": "Waystar Holding Corp. engages in the provision of healthcare organizations with mission-critical cloud software that simplifies healthcare payments. Its enterprise-grade platform streamlines the complex and disparate processes for improving the payments experience for providers, patients, and payers. The company was founded in 2000 and is headquartered in Lehi, UT.",
